7-science-7|Classify transport by plant tissue.|Xylem~Xylem primarily carries water and mineral ions from roots.|Water moving from root to leaf;Mineral ions moving up a stem|Phloem~Phloem carries organic food from sources to sinks.|Sucrose moving from leaf to fruit;Sugars moving to growing roots
